## 2. Walkthrough & Exam Drills

### Drill 1: Taints & Tolerations (`01-taints-tolerations/`)

1. **Inspect Worker Nodes**:

   ```bash
   kubectl get nodes -l '!node-role.kubernetes.io/control-plane'
   ```

1. **Apply Dedicated Taint to Worker Node**:

   ```bash
   kubectl taint nodes kube-worker-1 dedicated=analytics:NoSchedule --overwrite
   ```

1. **Deploy Tolerating and Intolerant Pods**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_scheduling_dir }}/01-taints-tolerations/cka-lab-tolerating-pod.yaml
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_scheduling_dir }}/01-taints-tolerations/cka-lab-intolerant-pod.yaml
   kubectl get pods -o wide
   ```

1. **Remove Taint**:

   ```bash
   kubectl taint nodes kube-worker-1 dedicated:NoSchedule-
   ```

### Drill 2: NodeAffinity and PodAntiAffinity (`02-affinities/`)

1. **Label Worker Node**:

   ```bash
   kubectl label nodes kube-worker-1 cka.zone=zone-a --overwrite
   ```

1. **Deploy NodeAffinity Pod & Anti-Affinity Deployment**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_scheduling_dir }}/02-affinities/cka-lab-node-affinity-pod.yaml
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_scheduling_dir }}/02-affinities/cka-lab-pod-anti-affinity-deploy.yaml
   kubectl get pods -o wide
   ```

### Drill 3: Horizontal Pod Autoscaling (`03-hpa-autoscaling/`)

1. **Deploy Target Application and HPA Resource**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_scheduling_dir }}/03-hpa-autoscaling/cka-lab-autoscale-app.yaml
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_scheduling_dir }}/03-hpa-autoscaling/cka-lab-hpa.yaml
   kubectl get hpa cka-lab-hpa
   ```

### Drill 4: Capacity Governance & Quotas (`04-quotas-limits/`)

1. **Deploy Quota and LimitRange**:

   ```bash
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_scheduling_dir }}/04-quotas-limits/cka-lab-quota-ns.yaml
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_scheduling_dir }}/04-quotas-limits/cka-lab-compute-quota.yaml
   kubectl apply -f {{ cka_lab_scheduling_dir }}/04-quotas-limits/cka-lab-limit-range.yaml
   kubectl describe resourcequota cka-lab-compute-quota -n {{ cka_lab_scheduling_capacity_namespace | default('cka-lab-capacity-ns') }}
   kubectl describe limitrange cka-lab-limit-range -n {{ cka_lab_scheduling_capacity_namespace | default('cka-lab-capacity-ns') }}
   ```

